<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-027-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-027 — logarithmic spiral claim validation — MorphoEval overall 67.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline implements Thompson's log-spiral law and fits a CC Nautilus photograph, but lacks parameter-regime sweep, shuffle ablation, KS/residual reporting in the figure, and Thompson figure overlay. Overall 67.9/100 (faithfulness 63.1, reproducibility 79.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f1d96f32; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.x, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.x, Pillow 12.x. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 78, Morphological realism / specimen match 62, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 82, Code-to-model traceability 74, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_027_the_logarithmic_spiral_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-027_the-logarithmic-spiral.py at f1d96f32, image/png, 573601 B, 1540×1400 px, artifact_sha256 0a56caf122a1996d91e150e8411136dc8295a8903a0296287706e92784e44872 (sha256 0a56caf122a1996d91e150e8411136dc8295a8903a0296287706e92784e44872), spec_fingerprint 2a5f73fc968e53e30990a81294c167772f366249834cc189f759b23138dd37b2. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2a5f73fc968e53e30990a81294c167772f366249834cc189f759b23138dd37b2; artifact_sha256: 0a56caf122a1996d91e150e8411136dc8295a8903a0296287706e92784e44872; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-027/nautilus_pompilius_specimen.jpg=ca3ae0f147e7cdf9..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-027/t1917_027_the_logarithmic_spiral_reference.json=ee8f5ec994ed23ec...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Thompson (1917) Ch. XI: gnomonic shell growth preserves form; spire centreline is an equiangular (logarithmic) spiral r ∝ exp(kθ); reconstructed_in_script: Polar edge sampling, ln r vs θ regression, Archimedean and power-spiral comparators, W = exp(2πk); transfer_boundary: 2D photograph projection ≠ perfect apical section; Raup (1966) adds D, T and generating-curve shape beyond Thompson's single k; does_not_claim: Exact match to Thompson's own 1917 figure digitisation or 3D CT centreline; refutation of Raup's qualified counterclaim." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/composer-2.5> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add parameter-regime sweep over k and W with recovery error bounds (Pass 2).",
        "remediation needed: Add shuffle ablation control on segmented radii to prove fit is not spurious.",
        "remediation needed: Add telemetry-friendly metrics CSV and Thompson 1917 figure citation overlay panel.",
        "remediation needed: Export AICc, KS p-value, and log-vs-Archimedean ΔAICc to measure_morphoeval and comparison figure.",
        "remediation needed: Improve conus segmentation or document mixed verdict when gastropod aspect ratio breaks planar log-spiral assumption." ;
    pk:hasScore 6.79e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

